The real content lives in `.agent/AGENTS.md`. Read it before doing anything.

The five invariants, in full in `.agent/rules/invariants.md`:

- R1 — Agents enter only through `src/mcp/handlers.ts`. No hidden routes, no globals.
- R2 — Humans and agents share one write door: `src/domain/commands.ts`.
- R3 — Only the command layer touches the database. `src/domain/db.ts` is the sole owner.
- R4 — The registry is a pure function `tools = f(uiState)`, computed only in `src/mcp/registry.ts`.
- R5 — `src/view/` and `src/panels/` are read-only. They never mutate.

Two frozen files. Changing either requires a task and a heads-up to the team:
`src/domain/schema.sql`, `src/mcp/descriptors.ts`.

No backend, no API routes, no runtime network calls.

English for code and docs. Product content is bilingual (`*_vi` / `*_en`).
